# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=fontconfig
pkgver=2.16.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Finds and configures the installed fonts"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/fontconfig/"
license=(HPND)
depends=(glibc freetype expat)
install=fontconfig.install
source=("https://www.freedesktop.org/software/fontconfig/release/fontconfig-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('6a33dc555cc9ba8b10caf7695878ef134eeb36d0af366041f639b1da9b6ed220')

build() {
    meson setup fontconfig-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var \
        --buildtype=release -D doc=disabled -D tests=disabled -D nls=disabled
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
